    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the quiet settle\"? what does that even mean... like just giving up? it feels like if i just stopped trying, nothing would actually change. the world would just keep spinning like i was never even there to begin with. it's almost like there's no difference between being alive and just being gone.",
