    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just sounds like a fancy way of saying i should just disappear. like, if i stop fighting and let the quiet take over, why am i even still here? if being invisible is how things are, then maybe i should just lean into it. maybe there's more peace in just... not being around at all.",
